---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About the research catalog | Reverse Engineer Lab">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="pip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>ABOUT THE INDEX</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        Understanding,<br />
        <em>with receipts.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Reverse Engineer Lab is an independent catalog of reverse engineering research and case
        studies. It is not affiliated with Reverse Engineer Anything.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="specimen-plate-wrap">
      <div class="corner-pin corner-pin-tl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="corner-pin corner-pin-br" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <aside class="diagram" aria-label="Empirical disassembly sequence">
        <div class="diagram-top">
          <strong>EMPIRICAL SEQUENCE</strong>
          <span>METHODOLOGY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="specimen-ruler" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="diagram-node">
          <div class="diagram-node-head">
            <span>SYSTEM</span>
            <span class="diagram-node-tag">TARGET</span>
          </div>
          <span class="diagram-node-sub">question, version, and revision scope</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trace-connector" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 26" fill="none">
            <line class="trace-line-base" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="21" />
            <line class="trace-line-pulse" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="21" />
            <path class="trace-arrow" d="M8.5 18.5L12 24L15.5 18.5H8.5Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="diagram-node is-evidence">
          <div class="diagram-node-head">
            <span>EVIDENCE</span>
            <span class="diagram-node-tag">OBSERVED</span>
          </div>
          <span class="diagram-node-sub">public links, artifacts, and measured behavior</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trace-connector" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 26" fill="none">
            <line class="trace-line-base" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="21" />
            <line class="trace-line-pulse" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="21" />
            <path class="trace-arrow" d="M8.5 18.5L12 24L15.5 18.5H8.5Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="diagram-node is-understanding">
          <div class="diagram-node-head">
            <span>UNDERSTANDING</span>
            <span class="diagram-node-tag">BOUNDED</span>
          </div>
          <span class="diagram-node-sub">inferences separated from explicit unknowns</span>
        </div>
        <div class="diagram-bottom">
          <span>No black boxes. No borrowed certainty.</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="taxonomy-strip" aria-label="Claim taxonomy">
    <div class="taxonomy-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="pip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>01 / OBSERVED</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Inspected facts</h3>
      <p>
        Direct observations from public artifacts, protocol schemas, or measured behavior at a named
        version.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="taxonomy-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="pip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>02 / INFERRED</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Architectural reasoning</h3>
      <p>
        Explanations of what observed facts likely mean when internal server state is not directly
        witnessed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="taxonomy-card is-amber">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="pip pip-amber" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>03 / UNKNOWN</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Where evidence ends</h3>
      <p>
        Explicit boundaries showing what was not tested, attached, or verified during the
        investigation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="pillars-stack">
    <section class="pillar-card">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">01 / SCOPE</div>
        <h2>Research takes different shapes</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        A binary analysis, API investigation, or architecture teardown will not produce the same
        report. The shared foundation is a clear question, a target and revision, findings, public
        evidence, and honest limitations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="pillar-card">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">02 / DISCIPLINE</div>
        <h2>Separate observation from inference</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Observed facts come from inspected artifacts or measured behavior. Inferences explain what
        those facts might mean. Unknowns describe where the evidence ends. Publication means an
        editor reviewed the submission, not that every conclusion is independently reproduced.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="pillar-card">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">03 / SAFETY</div>
        <h2>Contribute safely</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Share original text and public HTTPS links. Prefer evidence pinned to a revision. Do not
          submit credentials, private links, personal data, or proprietary source. We do not fetch
          or execute submitted URLs. Editors can approve a submission or deny it with a recorded
          reason.
        </p>
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/submit">
          <span>Submit an investigation</span>
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
